  m_text: "<size=19>- After each respin, if                lands on a position with
    NO               ,  then\n                  appears on that position and the value
    displayed on                   is transferred to                .\r\n\r\n- After
    each respin, if x2, x3, x4, or x5 lands on               , then it multiplies
    the value of                 on that position.\r\n\r\n- After each respin if  +1
    Spin lands on                , then it adds 1 spin to total number of respins.
    \r\n\r\n- After all respins end, the value displayed in each                 is
    awarded.\r\n\r\n- Other symbol pays are not evaluated during the Respin Bonus.\r\n</size>"
